  "description_html": "A cast of BYU 9025, the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/holotype\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:holotype\">holotype</a> fossil of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sauropod\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:sauropod\">sauropod</a> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/dinosaur\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:dinosaur\">dinosaur</a> <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supersaurus\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Supersaurus\">Supersaurus</a></i>, a giant <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/scapulocoracoid\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:scapulocoracoid\">scapulocoracoid</a> measuring 2.4m long.\n<dl><dd>• The source photo was taken at the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dinosaur_Journey_Musuem\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Dinosaur Journey Musuem\">Dinosaur Journey Musuem</a>.</dd>\n<dd>• Notes regarding the file; This image was edited and extracted from the original seen here. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://svpow.files.wordpress.com/2014/04/img_4505.jpg\">[1]</a> The Photoshop CC lens correction profile and a 'perspective warp' correction were applied.</dd></dl>",
